Third-party data
----------------
The trained model in models/ was built using third-party datasets with their
own terms, listed in bench/DATA.md:

  * ESC-50 (CC BY-NC 3.0) - non-commercial use only
  * Coswara, Indian Institute of Science (CC BY 4.0) - attribution required
  * Free Spoken Digit Dataset (CC BY-SA 4.0)

Because of ESC-50, the current model (models/hush_tcn_v2.npz and the weights
compiled into engine/src/model_weights.inc) may only be used non-commercially,
regardless of any permission granted for the code.
